      "x": -480,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "## Roshaan 2026 — AHEAD\nAdaptive Hierarchical Edge Detection\nSilhouette / Structure / Texture layers\nMax-pooling fusion · Real-time shader\n**Direct parallel to edge pipeline**",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "paper-xie",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -60,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "## Xie et al. 2025 — CGF\nScreentone-Preserved Manga Retargeting\nHierarchical grid anchors · RPSM\nTranslation-invariant screentone loss\n**Domain overlap with tone pipeline**",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "paper-liu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 340,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "## Liu et al. 2025 — SIVP\nPencil drawing via hybrid noise\nMulti-scale noise composition\n**Technique overlap with noise stages**",
